  "solution": "$$B = \\frac{\\mu_0 NI}{2R} = \\frac{4\\pi \\times 10^{-7} \\times 100 \\times 7}{2 \\times 0.1} = 4.4 \\times 10^{-3}\\ \\text{T} = 4.4\\ \\text{mT}$$",
